# Earth's Moon: sources and image credits

Verified 29 October 2026. Issue 02 in the Space Explorer Grade 5 series. English text is adapted from the supplied Moon prototype and checked against the NASA sources below. Translations are comprehension supports; they have not been independently reviewed by native-speaking educators.

## Authentic NASA imagery

All displayed media are local. No image requires a live connection to NASA. The original JPEGs and PNG were downloaded from NASA's asset host, decoded and inspected, then resized proportionally. No generated content was added and no scientific features were retouched. File sizes, dimensions and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in `assets/images/manifest.json`.

